  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p><table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"tr-caption-container\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuit-aWVQsfgS9SvjM0me7PE64sBr5qNGBXk-_XfU6vX2ZQ6ZYRRYjenktY44F0yXAgPnOW2QKzw84gYJLuavl12UMmbgTbjulGtqlGPaUnoAp5oz64Uys9OjtApPd-NajPvWESZz49BkFVtVeaCvHLKcGAV3LnEHRKA3VOuk8_-G-23nCXgMA3VeXuC4/s163/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"><img alt=\"איור המסמל תרשים זרימה\" border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"147\" data-original-width=\"163\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjuit-aWVQsfgS9SvjM0me7PE64sBr5qNGBXk-_XfU6vX2ZQ6ZYRRYjenktY44F0yXAgPnOW2QKzw84gYJLuavl12UMmbgTbjulGtqlGPaUnoAp5oz64Uys9OjtApPd-NajPvWESZz49BkFVtVeaCvHLKcGAV3LnEHRKA3VOuk8_-G-23nCXgMA3VeXuC4/s16000/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" /></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tr-caption\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: x-small;\">תרשים זרימה</span></td></tr></tbody></table><br /><p></p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\">מכנה משותף</span></h2><div><div><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">בסיפור התנ\"כי הבא, ישנו מוטיב דומה לקיים בפרשתנו. מהו?</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">רמז: תמונת השער לפוסט</span></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: large;\"></span></p><blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">וּדְבוֹרָה אִשָּׁה נְבִיאָה אֵשֶׁת לַפִּידוֹת הִיא שֹׁפְטָה אֶת יִשְׂרָאֵל בָּעֵת הַהִיא;&nbsp;וְהִיא יוֹשֶׁבֶת תַּחַת תֹּמֶר דְּבוֹרָה בֵּין הָרָמָה וּבֵין בֵּית אֵל בְּהַר אֶפְרָיִם&nbsp;וַיַּעֲלוּ אֵלֶיהָ בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל לַמִּשְׁפָּט;&nbsp;וַתִּשְׁלַח וַתִּקְרָא לְבָרָק בֶּן אֲבִינֹעַם מִקֶּדֶשׁ נַפְתָּלִי וַתֹּאמֶר אֵלָיו&nbsp;הֲלֹא צִוָּה ה' אֱלֹקי יִשְׂרָאֵל לֵךְ וּמָשַׁכְתָּ בְּהַר תָּבוֹר וְלָקַחְתָּ עִמְּךָ עֲשֶׂרֶת אֲלָפִים אִישׁ&nbsp;מִבְּנֵי נַפְתָּלִי וּמִבְּנֵי זְבֻלוּן;&nbsp;וּמָשַׁכְתִּי אֵלֶיךָ אֶל נַחַל קִישׁוֹן אֶת סִיסְרָא שַׂר צְבָא יָבִין וְאֶת רִכְבּוֹ וְאֶת הֲמוֹנוֹ וּנְתַתִּיהוּ בְּיָדֶךָ;&nbsp;וַיֹּאמֶר אֵלֶיהָ בָּרָק אִם תֵּלְכִי עִמִּי וְהָלָכְתִּי וְאִם לֹא תֵלְכִי עִמִּי לֹא אֵלֵךְ</span></blockquote><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"></span><p></p><div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 20px;\"></p><div><h2 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h2><div><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"background-color: white;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 גל-קול חוזר<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 אהב</span></span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"color: #202122;\">\n</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 מילה שמשמעה \"האם תהיה לי ידיעה?\"\n</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 צמיד לרגל (מהפרשה)\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 תהלוכה\n</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 רקה\n</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; text-decoration-line: inherit; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">🔲 שמח</span></span></p></span><h2 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">פתרונות</span></span></h2><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מכנה משותף</span></h3><p></p><p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">\"תנאי כפול\":&nbsp;<br /> ברק אמר: אם תלכי - אלך, ואם לא - לא אלך.<br />משה אמר: אם יעברו חלוצים - יקבלו נחלה, ואם לא - לא יקבלו.</span></p><p></p><h3 style=\"background-color: white; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; margin: 1em 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">מדרגאות</span></span></h3><p style=\"background-color: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">הד, אהד, האדע, אצעדה, צעדה, צדע, דץ</span></span></p></div></div></div>"
